  "_comment": "Engine registry of the community node image (docker/node.Dockerfile, M24-8). Absolute paths inside the container. Stockfish: the sf_19 universal build (amd64: verified release asset; arm64: built from the pinned source), which selects its instruction set at runtime. maia-*: Lc0 (scripts/build-lc0.sh) with the Maia nets (scripts/fetch-maia.sh); disabled automatically when the image was built with WITH_MAIA=0 or MAIA=off. The node-wide cap is MAX_SESSIONS / NODE_MAX_SESSIONS; maxInstances only bounds a single engine.",
